  wrongExp: "• <strong>Option A (Administer Epinephrine):</strong> Epinephrine is given AFTER the second shock in the VF/pVT algorithm. It is given immediately for non-shockable rhythms (Asystole/PEA).<br>• <strong>Option C (Intubate the patient):</strong> Defibrillation takes precedence over advanced airway placement. CPR and shocking are the highest priorities.<br>• <strong>Option D (Administer Amiodarone):</strong> Amiodarone is an antiarrhythmic considered only after the third shock in refractory VF/pVT."
